  "content": "\n\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/Ol1Tcf8.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"95\" height=\"32\"></span></strong></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size:18px\">现代玻璃门</span></strong></p>\n<p>厌倦了没有玻璃的普通且单调的门吗？无需再找，《玻璃门》旨在用更具现代感的门为你的世界增添新意。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>只需在合成台中将普通门与玻璃板组合，或手持玻璃板右键点击已有门，即可制作出玻璃门版本。</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/kyrptonaught/Glass-Doors/master/images/2019-07-09_16.47.56.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"480\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/kyrptonaught/Glass-Doors/master/images/2020-09-27_02.12.44.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"854\" height=\"480\"></p>\n<p>特别感谢 <strong><span>RetroBarbare</span></strong> 提供创意并负责纹理制作！</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>",
